{
  "info": {
    "title": "Agreed API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "The Agreed API is organized around REST. It has predictable resource-oriented URLs, accepts JSON-encoded request bodies (OAuth endpoints also accept form-encoded bodies), returns JSON, and uses standard HTTP response codes and verbs.\n\n**Base URL:** `https://agreed.net`\n\n## We support two integration pathways\n\n1. **Zapier, ChatGPT, Claude and other apps:** OAuth 2.0 (authorization code flow, with refresh tokens).\n    \n2. **Custom scripts and direct API requests:** a personal API key (Bearer token).\n    \n\n---\n\n## 🔑 Authentication\n\nEvery API request sends a Bearer token in the `Authorization` header:\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>\n\n ```\n\nThe token is either an **OAuth access token** (starts with `agrat_`) or a **personal API key** (starts with `agr_`). Both identify the same Agreed account and have the same access.\n\n### 1\\. Personal API key\n\nFor scripts or direct REST requests.\n\n**How to get your API key:**\n\n1. Log in to your Agreed account.\n    \n2. Go to **Settings → Integrations → Claude**.\n    \n3. Create a new key and copy it. It is shown only once.\n    \n4. Send it as `Authorization: Bearer agr_…`\n    \n\nKeys don't expire. Delete a key in the same place to revoke it.\n\n### 2\\. OAuth 2.0 (Zapier and other apps)\n\nAgreed is a standard OAuth 2.0 authorization server.\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Discovery document | `GET /.well-known/oauth-authorization-server` |\n| Authorization URL | `https://agreed.net/oauth/authorize` |\n| Token URL | `https://agreed.net/api/oauth/token` |\n| Revocation URL | `https://agreed.net/api/oauth/revoke` |\n| Scope | `mcp` |\n| Grant types | `authorization_code`, `refresh_token` |\n| PKCE | `S256`. Required for public clients (no secret); optional for confidential clients (with a client secret) |\n| Access token lifetime | 1 hour (`expires_in: 3600`) |\n| Refresh token lifetime | 30 days. Refresh tokens rotate: each refresh returns a new pair and the old refresh token stops working |\n\n**Flow:**\n\n1. Send the user to the Authorization URL. They sign in to Agreed and click **Allow** on the consent screen.\n    \n2. Agreed redirects back to your `redirect_uri` with `?code=…&state=…`.\n    \n3. Exchange the code at the Token URL for an `access_token` and `refresh_token`.\n    \n4. Call the API with `Authorization: Bearer` . When it expires, use the refresh token.\n    \n\nUsers can disconnect an app at any time in **Settings → Integrations**.\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ Webhooks (instant triggers)\n\nSubscribe a URL to an event and Agreed sends a `POST` to it with JSON every time the event happens.\n\n| Event | When |\n| --- | --- |\n| `document.viewed` | A recipient opened the document for the first time |\n| `document.signed` | A recipient finished signing their part |\n| `document.completed` | Every recipient has signed |\n\n**Delivery:**\n\n- `POST` with `Content-Type: application/json`, `User-Agent: Agreed-Webhooks/1.0`\n    \n- Headers `X-Agreed-Event` (event type), `X-Agreed-Delivery` (delivery id), `X-Agreed-Signature`\n    \n- Any 2xx response counts as delivered. Otherwise Agreed retries after 5 seconds and again after 30 seconds. The timeout is 10 seconds per attempt.\n    \n- Each event is sent once per subscription. Use the payload `id` to de-duplicate.\n    \n\n**Signature:** `X-Agreed-Signature: t=,v1=`, where `v1 = HMAC-SHA256(secret, \".\")`. The signing secret of an endpoint is shown in **Settings → Integrations → Webhooks**.\n\n**Payload:**\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"id\": \"cmwsy9ji40001jzeyuno2yuxp\",\n  \"type\": \"document.signed\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-11-23T07:34:09.917Z\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"document\": { \"id\": \"…\", \"name\": \"Non-Disclosure Agreement\", \"status\": \"sent\", \"url\": \"https://agreed.net/documents/…\" },\n    \"recipient\": { \"id\": \"…\", \"email\": \"jane@example.com\", \"firstName\": \"Jane\", \"lastName\": \"Doe\", \"viewedAt\": \"…\", \"signedAt\": \"…\" }\n  }\n}\n\n ```\n\n`document.completed` has no `recipient` object.\n\n---\n\n## Errors\n\nErrors return a JSON body `{ \"error\": \"...\", \"error_description\": \"...\" }` (or `{ \"error\": \"...\" }`).\n\n| Code | Meaning |\n| --- | --- |\n| 200 / 201 | Success |\n| 400 | Invalid request (missing or wrong parameters) |\n| 401 | Missing, invalid or expired token (`invalid_token`) or bad client credentials (`invalid_client`) |\n| 404 | Not found |\n| 429 | Too many requests. Slow down and retry |\n| 500 | Something went wrong on our side |\n\n## Rate limits\n\n- Token endpoint: 60 requests per minute per IP\n    \n- Webhook subscriptions: 30 per minute per account; at most 50 webhook endpoints per account"
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication (OAuth 2.0)",
      "description": "Standard OAuth 2.0 authorization code flow. These requests don't use the Bearer token."
    },
    {
      "name": "Account",
      "description": "The signed-in account."
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhooks",
      "description": "REST-hook subscriptions for instant triggers. See the collection overview for the payload format and signature."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/me": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Account"
        ],
        "summary": "Get current user",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "id",
                    "email",
                    "name"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "id": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "name": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "email": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "email"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "200_OK": {
                    "value": {
                      "id": "cmabc123def456",
                      "name": "Jane Doe",
                      "email": "jane@acme.com"
                    },
                    "summary": "200 OK"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "OK"
          },
          "401": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "error_description"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "error_description": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "401_Unauthorized": {
                    "value": {
                      "error": "invalid_token",
                      "error_description": "Missing, invalid or expired access token."
                    },
                    "summary": "401 Unauthorized"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Unauthorized"
          }
        },
        "description": "Returns the Agreed account the token belongs to. Use it to test a connection, or to label it in your app (e.g. by email).",
        "operationId": "getApiV1Me",
        "x-fern-sdk-group-name": [
          "Account"
        ],
        "x-fern-sdk-method-name": "Get current user"
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/hooks": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Webhooks"
        ],
        "summary": "Subscribe to an event",
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "id",
                    "url",
                    "event",
                    "createdAt"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "id": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "uri"
                    },
                    "event": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "createdAt": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "date-time"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "201_Created": {
                    "value": {
                      "id": "cmwsy9ji40001jzeyuno2yuxp",
                      "url": "https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/standard/123/abc/",
                      "event": "document.completed",
                      "createdAt": "2026-11-23T07:34:09.917Z"
                    },
                    "summary": "201 Created"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Created"
          },
          "400": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "400_Bad_request": {
                    "value": {
                      "error": "Send { hookUrl, event } where event is one of: document.viewed, document.signed, document.completed."
                    },
                    "summary": "400 Bad request"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Bad Request"
          },
          "401": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "error_description"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "error_description": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "401_Unauthorized": {
                    "value": {
                      "error": "invalid_token",
                      "error_description": "Missing, invalid or expired access token."
                    },
                    "summary": "401 Unauthorized"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Unauthorized"
          }
        },
        "description": "Registers a URL to receive one event type (REST hook). Keep the returned `id`; you need it to unsubscribe.\n\n| Field | Type | |\n|---|---|---|\n| `hookUrl` | string, required | Public `https://` URL that receives the POSTs. (`url` is accepted as an alias.) |\n| `event` | string, required | `document.viewed`, `document.signed` or `document.completed` |\n\nThe subscription also appears in **Settings → Integrations → Webhooks**, where the user can see deliveries or remove it.",
        "operationId": "postApiV1Hooks",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "hookUrl",
                  "event"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "event": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "hookUrl": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uri"
                  }
                }
              },
              "examples": {
                "201_Created": {
                  "value": {
                    "event": "document.completed",
                    "hookUrl": "https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/standard/123/abc/"
                  },
                  "summary": "201 Created"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "x-fern-sdk-group-name": [
          "Webhooks"
        ],
        "x-fern-sdk-method-name": "Subscribe to an event"
      }
    },
    "/api/oauth/token": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Authentication (OAuth 2.0)"
        ],
        "summary": "Exchange code for tokens",
        "security": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "access_token",
                    "token_type",
                    "expires_in",
                    "refresh_token",
                    "scope"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "scope": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "expires_in": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "token_type": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "access_token": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "refresh_token": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "200_OK": {
                    "value": {
                      "scope": "mcp",
                      "expires_in": 3600,
                      "token_type": "Bearer",
                      "access_token": "agrat_…",
                      "refresh_token": "agrrt_…"
                    },
                    "summary": "200 OK"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "OK"
          },
          "400": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "error_description"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "error_description": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "400_Invalid_grant": {
                    "value": {
                      "error": "invalid_grant",
                      "error_description": "Authorization code already used."
                    },
                    "summary": "400 Invalid grant"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Bad Request"
          },
          "401": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "error_description"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "error_description": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "401_Invalid_client": {
                    "value": {
                      "error": "invalid_client",
                      "error_description": "Unknown client or bad credentials."
                    },
                    "summary": "401 Invalid client"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Unauthorized"
          }
        },
        "description": "Swaps the authorization code for an access token and a refresh token. Accepts `application/x-www-form-urlencoded` (standard) or JSON.",
        "operationId": "postApiOauthToken",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/x-www-form-urlencoded": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "grant_type",
                  "code",
                  "redirect_uri",
                  "client_id",
                  "client_secret"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "code": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "The `code` from the redirect."
                  },
                  "client_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Your client id. Or send client_id/secret with HTTP Basic auth."
                  },
                  "grant_type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Always `authorization_code`."
                  },
                  "redirect_uri": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Same redirect_uri as in the authorize step."
                  },
                  "client_secret": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Your client secret (confidential clients)."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "x-fern-sdk-group-name": [
          "Authentication (OAuth 2.0)"
        ],
        "x-fern-sdk-method-name": "Exchange code for tokens"
      }
    },
    "/oauth/authorize": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Authentication (OAuth 2.0)"
        ],
        "summary": "Authorize (browser redirect)",
        "security": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response"
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "response_type",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "code",
            "description": "Always `code`."
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "client_id",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "{{clientId}}",
            "description": "Your OAuth client id."
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "redirect_uri",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "{{redirectUri}}",
            "description": "Must exactly match a redirect URI registered for the client."
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "scope",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "mcp",
            "description": "Always `mcp`."
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "state",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "random-state-123",
            "description": "Opaque value returned unchanged. Use it to prevent CSRF."
          }
        ],
        "description": "Open this URL **in a browser**. It isn't an API call. The user signs in to Agreed (if needed) and sees a consent screen. On **Allow**, Agreed redirects to:\n\n```\n{redirect_uri}?code=agrac_…&state=random-state-123\n```\n\nOn **Deny**: `{redirect_uri}?error=access_denied&state=…`\n\nThe code is single-use and expires after 10 minutes.",
        "operationId": "getOauthAuthorize",
        "x-fern-sdk-group-name": [
          "Authentication (OAuth 2.0)"
        ],
        "x-fern-sdk-method-name": "Authorize (browser redirect)"
      }
    },
    "/api/oauth/revoke": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Authentication (OAuth 2.0)"
        ],
        "summary": "Revoke token",
        "security": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK"
          }
        },
        "description": "Disconnects the app (RFC 7009). Returns `200` with an empty body, including when the token was already invalid.",
        "operationId": "postApiOauthRevoke",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/x-www-form-urlencoded": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "token",
                  "client_id",
                  "client_secret"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "token": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "An access token or a refresh token. Revoking either one invalidates both tokens of that pair."
                  },
                  "client_id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "client_secret": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "x-fern-sdk-group-name": [
          "Authentication (OAuth 2.0)"
        ],
        "x-fern-sdk-method-name": "Revoke token"
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/hooks/sample": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Webhooks"
        ],
        "summary": "List recent events (sample data)",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "id",
                      "type",
                      "createdAt",
                      "data"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                      "id": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "data": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "required": [
                          "document",
                          "recipient"
                        ],
                        "properties": {
                          "document": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "required": [
                              "id",
                              "name",
                              "status",
                              "url"
                            ],
                            "properties": {
                              "id": {
                                "type": "string"
                              },
                              "url": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "format": "uri"
                              },
                              "name": {
                                "type": "string"
                              },
                              "status": {
                                "type": "string"
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          "recipient": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "required": [
                              "id",
                              "email",
                              "firstName",
                              "lastName",
                              "viewedAt",
                              "signedAt"
                            ],
                            "properties": {
                              "id": {
                                "type": "string"
                              },
                              "email": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "format": "email"
                              },
                              "lastName": {
                                "type": "string"
                              },
                              "signedAt": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "format": "date-time"
                              },
                              "viewedAt": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "format": "date-time"
                              },
                              "firstName": {
                                "type": "string"
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "type": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "createdAt": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "format": "date-time"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "200_OK": {
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "id": "cmwsy9ji40001jzeyuno2yuxp",
                        "data": {
                          "document": {
                            "id": "cmdoc123",
                            "url": "https://agreed.net/documents/cmdoc123",
                            "name": "Non-Disclosure Agreement",
                            "status": "sent"
                          },
                          "recipient": {
                            "id": "cmrcp456",
                            "email": "jane@example.com",
                            "lastName": "Doe",
                            "signedAt": "2026-11-23T07:34:09.000Z",
                            "viewedAt": "2026-11-23T07:30:00.000Z",
                            "firstName": "Jane"
                          }
                        },
                        "type": "document.signed",
                        "createdAt": "2026-11-23T07:34:09.917Z"
                      }
                    ],
                    "summary": "200 OK"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "OK"
          },
          "400": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "400_Bad_request": {
                    "value": {
                      "error": "Pass ?event=document.viewed | document.signed | document.completed"
                    },
                    "summary": "400 Bad request"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Bad Request"
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "event",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "document.signed",
            "description": "`document.viewed`, `document.signed` or `document.completed`"
          }
        ],
        "description": "Returns up to 3 recent events of that type for the account, newest first, in exactly the webhook payload format. With no events yet, it returns one example event. Use it to map fields before a real event arrives.",
        "operationId": "getApiV1HooksSample",
        "x-fern-sdk-group-name": [
          "Webhooks"
        ],
        "x-fern-sdk-method-name": "List recent events (sample data)"
      }
    },
